		(uuid "c921b07a-d5de-48ca-bc6f-47478e8dfcdd")
	)
	(text "v0.1.1\n- Fix for BNC footprint swapping signal and ground.\n- Fix for OPA990 footprint, rotating three pins.\n- Fix for mislabeling 1uF 2220 switching cap. This should be 2.2uF.\n- Fix for bad ground isolation for current sensors.\n- Fix for ERROR LED being hooked up to USB_DP and CAN1_TD pin.\n\nv0.2.0 (summer 2023)\n- Revised component symbol->footprint->model listings.\n- Updated component suppliers.\n- Swapped mounting holes to M3.\n- Added I/O power fuse.\n- Swapped I/O connectors to XT60PW.\n- Removed heatsink and some thermal jumpers.\n- Added HF low uF caps on I/O to remove switching noise.\n- Added CAN circuitry.\n- Removed BNC.\n\nv1.0.0rc (summer 2024)\n- Controller\n  - Convert Nucleo to bare chip. Upgraded perf chip.\n- Power Regulation\n  - Dedicated power regulation circuitry.\n  - Split supplies for functional domains.\n- Sensors\n  - Swap to isolated op-amps, update range and resolution.\n  - Temperature sensors for high risk components.\n- Gate Driver\n  - Isolated gate driver with extra protection circuitry.\n- Converter\n  - Updated perf specs (see converter sch).\n  - Antisurge snubber protection.\n  - Overvoltage zener protection.\n- Protection\n  - HV load switches.\n  - HW lockout control.\n  - Active load dissipation.\n- CAN\n  - Swapped out with TI chip.\n- Thermals\n  - Fan header and mounts for active cooling.\n  - Heatsink mounts for passive cooling.\n- *Hit board size, cost target of 75x50 mm^{2}, <100$/board.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.784 133.858 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
